  <script src="/public/js/stage-mic.js?v=17"></script><%# micfollow: 🎙 On the mic - the pad's mic-follows stage (needs WebRTC); 1.99ahp v9: stable slots (v8 was 1.99ahn's resuming…); 1.99ahq v10: the stage cover; 1.99aid (privacy controls S5) v11: veiled cams; (S4) v12: 👁 View cam on a cover; (V-1) v13: 📌 a veiled cam from the picker; (1.99ajw padppl rework) v16: the "not the Camfrog user" tag on a tile; (dock3 1.99akf) v17: no such tag %>
